=about vash

        vash, Visual Assistant for shell
        Copyright (C) 1990-1993,1996,2018-2024 Sergey Vovk <vsv>

 Vash provides variety of tools intended to speedup user interaction with
 command line, designed to be intuitive and simple. 

 Please, refer to 'man vash' for details.

 .:HE... - get help pages. This key switches between 2 pages:
 1st page is content-dependent, and 2nd one is about common dialogue keys.
 Any other key will return from help context.

 Vash dialogues are splitted up by contexts, such as main view, command editor,
 setup page and other. In every context, similar actions are performed with
 same keys, with some resonable exclusions.
 
 Visual representation of dialogues and keyboard assignments may be changed
 on Your taste with 'vhset' command. Please, refer to 'man vhset' for details.

---END
